          "settings": {
            "name": "Bradley M.",
            "title": "Beautiful transfers",
            "body": "More than a few orders down and the DTF transfers have been beautiful and perfect every single time! The colors are bright and look great. Easy to use and fast, safe shipping. Our club members love them! The upload process is easy and quick.",
